<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Cotización {{ quotation.folio }} | PrintFlow</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:32px 16px;background:#f2f7f4;color:#0b1c30;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"><tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width:560px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 36px 12px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"><tr>
<td valign="top"><p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#287a4d;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">PrintFlow</p><h1 style="margin:0;color:#0b1c30;font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;">Tu cotización está lista</h1></td>
<td width="190" align="right" valign="top"><div style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 12px;border:2px solid #d92d20;border-radius:8px;background:#fff1f0;color:#b42318;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;text-align:center;">FECHA DE ENTREGA:<br><span style="font-size:14px;">{{ deliveryDate is defined and deliveryDate ? deliveryDate|date('d/m/Y') : 'POR CONFIRMAR' }}</span></div></td>
</tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 36px 32px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;"><p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Hola{% if recipientName %} {{ recipientName }}{% endif %},</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Adjuntamos la cotización <strong>{{ quotation.folio }}</strong> por un total de <strong>${{ quotation.total|number_format(2, '.', ',') }} {{ quotation.currency }}</strong>.</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Su vigencia concluye el <strong>{{ quotation.expiresAt|date('d/m/Y') }}</strong>.</p>{% if message %}<div style="margin:20px 0;padding:16px;border-left:4px solid #287a4d;background:#f3faf5;white-space:pre-line;">{{ message }}</div>{% endif %}<p style="margin:20px 0 0;color:#52625a;font-size:14px;">Si tienes alguna duda o requieres ajustes, responde a este correo.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 36px;background:#e8f3ec;color:#52625a;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left;">{% include 'emails/quotations/_privacy_notice.html.twig' %}</td></tr>
</table></td></tr></table></body></html>
